  "description": "Provides SQL Server database driver integration and SQL dialect support for XCode, with automatic modeling migration, cache cooperation and high-performance data access. 为 XCode 提供 SQL Server 数据库驱动接入与方言支持，支持自动建模迁移、缓存协同与高性能数据访问。",
